#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These functions round I<x> to the nearest integer, but round halfway cases "
"away from zero (regardless of the current rounding direction, see "
"B<fenv>(3)), instead of to the nearest even integer like B<rint>(3)."
msgstr ""
"Ces fonctions arrondissent leur I<x> à l'entier le plus proche, en "
"s'éloignant de zéro (sans tenir compte de la direction d'approximation en "
"cours, consultez B<fenv>(3)), à la différence de l'arrondi vers l'entier "
"pair le plus proche comme B<rint>(3)."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "For example, I<round(0.5)> is 1.0, and I<round(-0.5)> is -1.0."
msgstr "Par exemple, I<round(0,5)> vaut 1,0 et I<round(-0,5)> vaut -1,0."

